{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわ～（＾ω＾）❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なあだよ？まにだよ？まにです！\nなあまに。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/02/02/6851162/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ～。なあのヘアスタイル気になるで❤️わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/02/02/6851162/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はカフェに居るよぉ。\n4人掛けのテーブルに1人だから少し寂しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもこうやって 1人でぼぉ～っとする時間が大好きなの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でねでね最近観た映画の話をしようと思って（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね，『ANNIE/アニー』めえっっちゃ良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな映画って人によると思いますけど、音楽が好きな私には『ANNIE/アニー』は大好きでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画館で足でリズムとりながら観るってこと初めてだったし、\n何故かどっか自分の幼い頃と重ね合わさる所があって、始まってすぐ涙が...  ラスト号泣。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いもあって、本当に楽しくて感動する、夢を与える様な素晴らしい映画でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ観てないよ～！って方も時間があれば是非♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、ベイマックスも観たい。。。\nNARUTOもTSUTAYAで借りることになっちゃいそう（ ｉ _ ｉ ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画っていいですね❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えいっ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/02/02/6851162/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合わせた訳やないけど，なんとなく表情が2人して同じ感じに...。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/02/02/6851162/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほら（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/02/02/6851162/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わー。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2015/02/02/6851162/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ。blog書いてる間にコーヒーが冷めちゃったね。わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあええか❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆 今日もお疲れ様ね。またね。"}],"source":"archive"}